      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Iron_City%2C_Tennessee",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "A 1877 state act shifted the county line so that Iron City became entirely part of Lawrence County before it officially incorporated.",
